@startuml
autonumber
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center
skinparam roundCorner 0
skinparam ArrowColor black
skinparam defaultFontColor black
skinparam sequence {
    ArrowColor black
    LifeLineBorderColor black
    ParticipantBorderColor black
    ParticipantBackgroundColor white
    ParticipantFontColor black
}

participant "Maintainer" as U
participant "GitHub Actions" as H
participant "Approve Script" as S
participant "Build / Test" as B
participant "GitHub Pages" as P
participant "Issue" as I

U -> H: Trigger approve-submission
H -> S: node scripts/approve-submission.mjs
S -> S: recheck approval + security baseline
S --> H: updated registry source
H -> B: npm run build + npm test
B --> H: pass
H -> P: upload publication + Pages artifact
H -> P: deploy
H -> I: label listed + close
P --> U: Published catalog
note over H: Deployment only runs after build and tests pass.
@enduml
